(property "Design_note" "1 +3V3, 2 GND, 3 SDA, 4 SCL. XH clone, right angle; real pitch is the JST XH 2.50 mm; check pitch and wire order of the purchased part and the sensor cable" (at 45.72 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (hide yes)))
